# Cloudflare Pages serves any matching static asset before applying these rules,
# so hashed JS/CSS under /assets/ is unaffected.
#
# This project ships no top-level 404.html, which already makes Pages fall back
# to the SPA behaviour described in the docs. The rule below states that intent
# explicitly so a future 404.html cannot silently change routing.
/*
  /index.html  200
